   "source": [
    "# Build Report 4B: Student Flow Changes (LP)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Start with all flows to congested public JHS\n",
    "report4b = flow_to_congested[['school_id_origin', 'school_id_destination', \n",
    "                               'count_esc_beneficiary', 'count_non_beneficiary']].copy()\n",
    "report4b['original_total'] = report4b[['count_esc_beneficiary','count_non_beneficiary']].sum(axis=1)\n",
    "report4b.rename(columns={\n",
    "    'count_esc_beneficiary': 'original_beneficiaries',\n",
    "    'count_non_beneficiary': 'original_non_beneficiaries'\n",
    "}, inplace=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Aggregate LP redirections by (origin, destination)\n",
    "lp_by_flow = redirections_lp.groupby(\n",
    "    ['school_id_origin', 'school_id_destination']\n",
    ").agg({\n",
    "    'count_redirected_lp': 'sum',\n",
    "    'private_esc_id': 'nunique'\n",
    "}).reset_index()\n",
    "lp_by_flow.columns = ['school_id_origin', 'school_id_destination', 'students_redirected', 'num_private_partners']\n",
    "\n",
    "# Find top private ESC per flow (most students redirected)\n",
    "top_private_lp = redirections_lp.loc[\n",
    "    redirections_lp.groupby(['school_id_origin', 'school_id_destination'])['count_redirected_lp'].idxmax()\n",
    "][['school_id_origin', 'school_id_destination', 'private_esc_id', 'count_redirected_lp', 'distance_to_private_km']].copy()\n",
    "top_private_lp.columns = ['school_id_origin', 'school_id_destination', \n",
    "                           'top_private_esc_id', 'top_private_count', 'distance_origin_to_top_private_km']\n",
    "\n",
    "# Merge redirections with original flow\n",
    "report4b = report4b.merge(lp_by_flow, on=['school_id_origin', 'school_id_destination'], how='left')\n",
    "report4b['students_redirected'] = report4b['students_redirected'].fillna(0)\n",
    "report4b['num_private_partners'] = report4b['num_private_partners'].fillna(0).astype(int)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Merge top private ESC info\n",
    "report4b = report4b.merge(top_private_lp, on=['school_id_origin', 'school_id_destination'], how='left')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Calculate remaining and percentage\n",
    "report4b['remaining_non_beneficiaries'] = report4b['original_non_beneficiaries'] - report4b['students_redirected']\n",
    "report4b['pct_redirected'] = np.where(\n",
    "    report4b['original_non_beneficiaries'] > 0,\n",
    "    (report4b['students_redirected'] / report4b['original_non_beneficiaries']) * 100,\n",
    "    0\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Add origin school info\n",
    "report4b = report4b.merge(\n",
    "    sch_info_slim[['school_id', 'school_name', 'division']],\n",
    "    left_on='school_id_origin',\n",
    "    right_on='school_id',\n",
    "    how='left'\n",
    ").drop(columns='school_id')\n",
    "report4b.rename(columns={'school_name': 'school_name_origin', 'division': 'division_origin'}, inplace=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Add destination school info\n",
    "report4b = report4b.merge(\n",
    "    sch_info_slim[['school_id', 'school_name', 'division']],\n",
    "    left_on='school_id_destination',\n",
    "    right_on='school_id',\n",
    "    how='left'\n",
    ").drop(columns='school_id')\n",
    "report4b.rename(columns={'school_name': 'school_name_destination', 'division': 'division_destination'}, inplace=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Add top private ESC name\n",
    "report4b = report4b.merge(\n",
    "    sch_info_slim[['school_id', 'school_name']],\n",
    "    left_on='top_private_esc_id',\n",
    "    right_on='school_id',\n",
    "    how='left'\n",
    ").drop(columns='school_id')\n",
    "report4b.rename(columns={'school_name': 'top_private_esc_name'}, inplace=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Reorder columns\n",
    "report4b = report4b[[\n",
    "    'school_id_origin', 'school_name_origin', 'division_origin',\n",
    "    'school_id_destination', 'school_name_destination', 'division_destination',\n",
    "    'original_total', 'original_beneficiaries', 'original_non_beneficiaries',\n",
    "    'students_redirected', 'remaining_non_beneficiaries', 'pct_redirected',\n",
    "    'num_private_partners', 'top_private_esc_id', 'top_private_esc_name', \n",
    "    'top_private_count', 'distance_origin_to_top_private_km'\n",
    "]]\n",
    "\n",
    "# Sort by students_redirected descending\n",
    "report4b = report4b.sort_values('students_redirected', ascending=False)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Report 4B shape: {report4b.shape}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Flows with redirections: {(report4b['students_redirected'] > 0).sum():,}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Flows without redirections: {(report4b['students_redirected'] == 0).sum():,}\")\n",
    "display(report4b.head(10))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "report5_markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2.7. Report 5: Slot Expansion Priorities\n",
    "\n",
    "**Purpose:** Identify which private ESC schools should receive additional slots to maximize congestion reduction.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Logic:** For each flow with remaining demand after LP optimization, assign it to the \"best\" capacity-constrained private school using priority score (nearest + cheapest). Each flow is assigned to exactly ONE school to avoid double-counting.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Assignment Rule:**\n",
    "```\n",
    "priority_score = norm_distance + TUITION_WEIGHT × norm_tuition\n",
    "Assign flow → private school with LOWEST priority_score\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Columns (13 total):**\n",
    "\n",
    "| Category | Columns |\n",
    "|----------|---------|\n",
    "| School Info | `private_esc_id`, `private_esc_name`, `division`, `region` |\n",
    "| Current Capacity | `total_slots`, `available_slots_before`, `slots_used_lp`, `utilization_rate` |\n",
    "| Expansion Potential | `unique_blocked_demand`, `num_assigned_flows`, `num_congested_jhs_affected` |\n",
    "| Cost/Distance | `tuition_jhs`, `avg_priority_score` |\n",
    "\n",
    "**Key Metric:** `unique_blocked_demand` = students assigned exclusively to this school (no double-counting across schools)"
   ]
  },
