   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "baseline_explain_001",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3.8. Baseline Values for Stakeholder Comparison\n",
    "\n",
    "Before generating the comparison table, we compute baseline metrics that represent the **current state** of the ESC program:\n",
    "\n",
    "| Metric | Description | Source |\n",
    "|--------|-------------|--------|\n",
    "| Private ESC schools used | Count of schools currently serving ESC beneficiaries | `esc_available['current_beneficiaries'] > 0` |\n",
    "| Avg redirect distance | Weighted average distance from origin ES to private ESC for current beneficiaries | Distance matrix + flow data |\n",
    "| Slot utilization | Current beneficiaries / Total slots | `esc_available` aggregation |\n",
    "\n",
    "**Note:** The baseline represents students already enrolled in private ESC schools. The optimization adds **new** redirections on top of this baseline."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 42,
   "id": "baseline_compute_001",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "BASELINE VALUES COMPUTED:\n",
      "  Private ESC schools currently serving beneficiaries: 1,026\n",
      "  Total current beneficiaries in ESC program: 50,241\n",
      "  Total ESC slots: 76,689\n",
      "  Baseline slot utilization: 65.5%\n",
      "  Baseline avg redirect distance: 12.68 km\n",
      "  (Based on 20,926 origin-ESC pairs with 39,933 beneficiaries)\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# =============================================================================\n",
    "# Compute Baseline Values for Stakeholder Comparison Table\n",
    "# =============================================================================\n",
    "\n",
    "# 1. Private ESC schools used (Baseline)\n",
    "# Count of unique private ESC schools currently serving beneficiaries\n",
    "baseline_esc_schools_used = (esc_available['current_beneficiaries'] > 0).sum()\n",
    "\n",
    "# 2. Slot utilization (Baseline)\n",
    "# Current beneficiaries / Total slots across all ESC schools\n",
    "total_current_beneficiaries = esc_available['current_beneficiaries'].sum()\n",
    "total_slots = esc_available['total_count_slots'].sum()\n",
    "baseline_slot_utilization = (total_current_beneficiaries / total_slots) * 100\n",
    "\n",
    "# 3. Avg redirect distance (Baseline)\n",
    "# Average distance from origin ES to private ESC destination for current beneficiaries\n",
    "# Filter flow data to only flows going to private ESC schools\n",
    "esc_school_ids = set(esc_in_loc['school_id'].tolist())\n",
    "flow_to_esc = flow[flow['school_id_destination'].isin(esc_school_ids)].copy()\n",
    "\n",
    "# Calculate distance for each (origin, destination) pair using distance matrix\n",
    "distances_baseline = []\n",
    "weights_baseline = []\n",
    "\n",
    "for _, row in flow_to_esc.iterrows():\n",
    "    origin_id = row['school_id_origin']\n",
    "    dest_id = row['school_id_destination']\n",
    "    beneficiaries = row['count_esc_beneficiary']\n",
    "    \n",
    "    if beneficiaries > 0 and origin_id in re_schids_to_idx and dest_id in re_schids_to_idx:\n",
    "        origin_idx = re_schids_to_idx[origin_id]\n",
    "        dest_idx = re_schids_to_idx[dest_id]\n",
    "        distance_m = dm[origin_idx, dest_idx]\n",
    "        \n",
    "        if distance_m < np.inf and distance_m > 0:\n",
    "            distances_baseline.append(distance_m / 1000)  # Convert to km\n",
    "            weights_baseline.append(beneficiaries)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Weighted average distance\n",
    "if weights_baseline:\n",
    "    baseline_avg_distance_km = np.average(distances_baseline, weights=weights_baseline)\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    baseline_avg_distance_km = np.nan\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"BASELINE VALUES COMPUTED:\")\n",
    "print(f\"  Private ESC schools currently serving beneficiaries: {baseline_esc_schools_used:,}\")\n",
    "print(f\"  Total current beneficiaries in ESC program: {total_current_beneficiaries:,.0f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"  Total ESC slots: {total_slots:,.0f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"  Baseline slot utilization: {baseline_slot_utilization:.1f}%\")\n",
    "print(f\"  Baseline avg redirect distance: {baseline_avg_distance_km:.2f} km\")\n",
    "print(f\"  (Based on {len(distances_baseline):,} origin-ESC pairs with {sum(weights_baseline):,.0f} beneficiaries)\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f3g4h5i6",
